2026-07-27T09:29:03.0442944Z i /tmp/Rtmp5UcQQQ/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:29:03.0443338Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:29:03.0443817Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:29:03.0444557Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:29:03.0445193Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:29:03.0446151Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:29:03.0447190Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
